# Optional. Most installs need no .env: make install derives these paths.
# Copying this file is optional and does not change any discovered setting.
# Private state follows XDG_STATE_HOME or the operator's account home. Codex
# login follows CODEX_HOME or that account's .codex directory.
# To override a path, add one of the following names with your actual absolute
# path after '='. Values are data: no shell expansion. Never put tokens here.
# ZELAB_PRIVATE_DIR=
# ZELAB_DEPLOY_KEY=
# ZELAB_KNOWN_HOSTS=
# ZELAB_CODEX_AUTH_FILE=
# Discord tokens are entered in the native Hermes Channels UI, not in this file.
